; PT-SWARM wave 15, boss (docs/33 C1-C3; decisions D344, D346). Group counts,
; offsets, intervals, bursts and the encounter alive cap are Register "v1.0
; Enemies, Bosses & Waves" > "Wave sequence" (about 10x the v1.0 counts;
; difficulty scales counts at spawn). Boss wave: the minion groups re-arm
; while the boss lives (D344), at about 40% of a normal wave's spawn rate.

